---
description: Superpowers — load skills via Read on SKILL.md (Cursor has no Skill tool)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Superpowers in Cursor

When this conversation involves planning, debugging, executing a written implementation plan, TDD, code review, git worktrees, or finishing a branch: **before** editing files or giving procedural steps, **Read** the matching skill from the Superpowers plugin, e.g. `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` (use the path from your agent skills list if shown).

Announce after loading: **Using [skill-name] to [purpose]**.

Full tool mapping: `skills/using-superpowers/references/cursor-tools.md` in the Superpowers plugin (or your fork).

User and project instructions still override skill steps when they conflict.
